{"lines":[{"x":0.10064530083620028,"h":0.015280056336743231,"c":1,"t":"Test 8","y":0.073755320643214217,"w":0.060026270548502611},{"w":0.016460905075073237,"x":0.10082304532254568,"y":0.36191860437519874,"t":"F","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.58575581370512075,"x":0.10493827185527031,"c":1,"t":"G","w":0.018518517812093099},{"c":1,"x":0.14598761040132141,"t":"One of the main criticisms of boards and their directors is that they do not focus","y":0.11752614421739027,"w":0.74918279012044264,"h":0.020054755418685399},{"c":1,"t":"sufficiently on longer-term matters of strategy, sustainability and governance,","x":0.1440329205362002,"w":0.73045267740885422,"h":0.017441860778592999,"y":0.13662790681313897},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.72427983601888024,"x":0.14609053474527817,"y":0.15400471131382232,"t":"but instead concentrate too much on short-term financial metrics. Regulatory","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.17127723242863802,"h":0.019193654908448599,"w":0.79023783365885425,"t":"requirements and the structure of the market encourage this behaviour. The tyranny","x":0.14602996571718657},{"y":0.18712118639247399,"c":1,"x":0.1459304545458997,"t":"of quarterly reporting can distort board decision-making, as directors have to 'make","w":0.78427052815755205,"h":0.022534677080889076},{"h":0.020191448737370332,"w":0.75334991455078115,"t":"the numbers' every four months to meet the insatiable appetite of the market for","x":0.14597074949012362,"c":1,"y":0.20626774879024568},{"h":0.020623893423271422,"c":1,"x":0.14597267362439273,"t":"more data. This serves to encourage the trading methodology of a certain kind of","y":0.22400926368468621,"w":0.7656851704915365},{"t":"investor who moves in and out of a stock without engaging in constructive dialogue","y":0.24263839808092136,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.78600824991861984,"x":0.14403291220434955},{"y":0.26148409913108672,"x":0.14609052995089447,"t":"with the company about strategy or performance, and is simply seeking a short-","h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"w":0.75514404296875004},{"t":"term financial gain. This effect has been made worse by the changing profile of","x":0.14597541083506285,"h":0.020569382342910281,"c":1,"y":0.27741395977543437,"w":0.74716827392578133},{"y":0.294878995930278,"t":"investors due to the globalisation of capital and the increasing use of automated","w":0.75547190348307292,"h":0.021764692344710568,"x":0.145932952470997,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"trading systems. Corporate culture adapts and management teams are largely","x":0.1480547612296681,"y":0.31403270748352363,"w":0.73887273152669275,"h":0.019139848131734638},{"w":0.34567901611328122,"t":"incentivised to meet financial goais.","y":0.33421672557806303,"h":0.016195524146054296,"c":1,"x":0.14609053303156497},{"t":"Compensation for chief executives has become a combat zone where pitched","w":0.73478561401367193,"c":1,"h":0.01946735494409213,"x":0.14804543915836027,"y":0.35869380249436367},{"w":0.73681620279947935,"h":0.019747656562724258,"x":0.14805930835215037,"y":0.37685149347554925,"c":1,"t":"battles between investors, management and board members are fought, often"},{"c":1,"w":0.767682596842448,"t":"behind closed doors but increasingly frequently in the full glare of press attention.","x":0.14805249576825788,"h":0.020843080131971115,"y":0.39372721614148098},{"y":0.41176778467862329,"h":0.021650339043463362,"c":1,"t":"Many would argue that this is in the interest of transparency and good governance","w":0.77802220662434896,"x":0.14803818647785136},{"t":"as shareholders use their muscle in the area of pay to pressure boards to","y":0.43168433446703969,"w":0.69341562906901044,"x":0.15020576571432542,"h":0.015990084276322869,"c":1},{"y":0.44708848592843342,"w":0.75132664998372389,"t":"remove underperforming chief executives. Their powers to vote down executive","x":0.14798673829982362,"h":0.020873497737170066,"c":1},{"y":0.46585826154029031,"w":0.74711507161458335,"x":0.14804530184859763,"h":0.019750606325686482,"c":1,"t":"remuneration policies increased when binding votes came into force. The chair"},{"c":1,"t":"of the remuneration committee can be an exposed and lonely role, as Alison","h":0.020532992197852318,"w":0.72038258870442706,"y":0.48374424530092108,"x":0.15008867449010579},{"t":"Carnwath, chair of Barclays Bank's remuneration committee, found when she had","y":0.50065583540638547,"w":0.77187230428059894,"h":0.021681546322448564,"x":0.15010165432161937,"c":1},{"x":0.14803197362665418,"t":"to resign, having been roundly criticised for trying to defend the enormous bonus","y":0.51862533817049417,"h":0.021140413093342247,"w":0.7636091105143229,"c":1},{"t":"to be paid to the chief executive; the irony being that she was widely understood to","c":1,"y":0.53705636398297318,"h":0.019884685745508834,"x":0.14805533004430316,"w":0.78413263956705725},{"c":1,"w":0.55368825276692701,"t":"have spoken out against it in the privacy of the committee.","h":0.019597254596975366,"x":0.1500963765776919,"y":0.55527361325565727},{"y":0.58274440507493008,"x":0.1502057657918193,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"t":"The financial crisis stimulated a debate about the role and purpose of the company","w":0.78189300537109363},{"x":0.15009142985259169,"t":"and a heightened awareness of corporate ethics. Trust in the corporation has been","w":0.78211481730143229,"y":0.60030988294031384,"h":0.019569504808621407,"c":1},{"y":0.61918604634842966,"t":"eroded and academics such as Michael Sandel, in his thoughtful and bestselling","x":0.15226337768318321,"w":0.75720163981119804,"c":1,"h":0.017445284570484998},{"y":0.63649529479811251,"h":0.018503053168666295,"t":"book What Money Can't Buy, are questioning the morality of capitalism and the","w":0.74706746419270842,"c":1,"x":0.15218458856917341},{"t":"market economy. Boards of companies in all sectors will need to widen their","x":0.15205082441529782,"y":0.65153431960466812,"w":0.71851186116536458,"h":0.022789504699347596,"c":1},{"x":0.15207664067552798,"w":0.73499704996744797,"h":0.023241854107141191,"c":1,"t":"perspective to encompass these issues and this may involve a realignment of","y":0.66999022403971054},{"c":1,"y":0.69040697654591943,"w":0.43209874471028648,"x":0.15226338541479606,"h":0.017484660423826903,"t":"corporate goals. We live in challenging times."},{"t":"90","x":0.10905349804554694,"y":0.94767441843259159,"w":0.024691357612609863,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721539984068,"y":0.96768258547277797,"w":0.20827172597249349,"c":1,"h":0.01645441358586508}],"w":2400,"h":3395}